src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260924/1179830157209374720724590.jpeg/voHCaCmxEGYJ8gJqfaBJ2MQIDqjazHygzHX2xdp19sU\"/><figcaption>愛協人員共檢獲逾10隻龜，其中品種包括美國紅耳龜、草龜及白化巴西龜，有一隻為死龜；另外亦檢獲一具貓屍。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方正在現場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260924/1179836196327526400916783.jpeg/fOTjANI5C7l7hTiv4JloICiqSix5KhXFKcEILj_BCC4\"/><figcaption>警方正在現場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員封鎖現場樓層調查。(黃偉民攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260924/1179815848173375488627904.jpeg/ctmro2rGt-EtJZhwpts3_bF7G0DPMlk_uQRJ-pwESfo\"/><figcaption>警員封鎖現場樓層調查。(黃偉民攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"愛護動物協會人員到場。(黃偉民攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260924/1179815850857861120124859.jpeg/6ZgsTSKOdV7LeAUfNm2GLGidtjGv8vUhl7rmA7K65gM\"/><figcaption>愛護動物協會人員到場。(黃偉民攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"愛護動物協會人員到場。(黃偉民攝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260924/1179815853580095488530972.jpeg/P8hVjt5gWJQvfQCk-sPVf-DzXsa-ztHeTAlY6GkJWOg\"/><figcaption>愛護動物協會人員到場。(黃偉民攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T14:19:50.908107+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1313,"images":16,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}